    "## 6. Literature Network Integration & Visualization\n",
    "The extracted biochemical attributes are integrated into a global citation network mapping the academic landscape:\n",
    "* **Corpus Integration:** Cross-referenced over 3,700 Litmaps reference/citation files with the seed papers.\n",
