    "* **Strict Activity Filtering:** Citation graphs are strictly filtered against triage folders, retaining only literature classified as positive for biological degradation.\n",
    "* **Master Network Dataset:** Generates `Global_Citation_Map_With_Enzymes.csv`, merging raw citation edges with Broad Enzyme Type, Specific Name, Substrate Class, Organism, Variant Counts and Publication Type.\n",
    "\n",
    "The master network file is imported into Gephi 0.11.2 for structural and temporal analysis:\n",
    "* **Temporal Cascading (Ordered Layout):** Anchors publications along a strict historical timeline axis to illustrate the sequential evolution of plastic degradation discoveries over time.\n",
    "* **Network Clustering (ForceAtlas 2 & Modularity):** Applies force-directed layout algorithms alongside modularity calculations to group publications with high citation overlap and identify distinct research silos.\n",
    "* **Hierarchical Grouping (Circle Pack Layout):** Groups publication clusters hierarchically based on broader enzymatic classes and substrate target categories."
